  "corrections": [
    "Earlier pin-research notes misread M313 as M1313 and the half-inch expansion plug as1-1/2in. Rotated original SNL137 and independent SNL126/156 confirm M313 and1/2in. No prior candidate geometry used the incorrect plug dimension."
