  "identity_disposition": [
    "Use M282 large bronze bush from original SNL43 and HB122 callout23; M272 belongs to the small bush in SNL44 and HB122callout32. SNL251/252 appear to transpose the bronze-bush marks. Preserve both records without merging survey IDs.",
